<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Our Story | Orange Ride</title>
<style>
:root {
  --orange: #ff6500;
  --ink: #202020;
  --cream: #f7f5ef;
  --gray: #686868;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
}
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
header {
  background: #fff;
  min-height: 78px;
  padding: 18px 8%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e2d9;
}
.logo { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; }
.logo span { color: var(--orange); }
nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
nav a { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1px; }
nav a:hover { color: var(--orange); }
.nav-cta { background: var(--ink); color: white; padding: 13px 16px; }
.page-intro {
  padding: 65px 8% 55px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr .7fr;
  align-items: end;
  gap: 35px;
}
.kicker { color: var(--orange); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2.5px; }
h1 {
  font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px);
  line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -4px;
  margin-top: 22px; max-width: 720px;
}
h1 span { color: var(--orange); }
.intro-copy { color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.9; font-size: 15px; max-width: 400px; padding-bottom: 5px; }
.story {
  margin: 0 8%;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
  min-height: 410px;
  background: #fff;
}
.story-image { min-height: 380px; background: #ddd; overflow: hidden; }
.story-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 380px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
.story-copy { padding: clamp(25px, 5vw, 60px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
.story-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin: 15px 0 20px; }
.story-copy p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 14px; }
.signature { color: var(--orange); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-top: 15px; }
.philosophy { padding: 90px 8%; }
.philosophy-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 25px; margin-bottom: 35px; }
.philosophy h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 50px); letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin-top: 12px; }
.philosophy-head p { max-width: 350px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 14px; }
.values { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
.value {
  border-top: 3px solid var(--orange);
  padding: 25px 22px 28px;
  background: #fff;
}
.value .number { font-size: 12px; color: var(--orange); font-weight: 900; }
.value h3 { font-size: 21px; margin: 18px 0 12px; }
.value p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray); }
.contact {
  background: var(--orange);
  padding: 60px 8%;
  display: flex; align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between; gap: 25px;
}
.contact h2 { color: white; font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 55px); letter-spacing: -2px; }
.contact p { color: #fff0e7; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 450px; }
.contact .btn {
  flex-shrink: 0; background: #fff; color: var(--ink);
  padding: 16px 22px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px;
}
.contact .btn:hover { background: var(--ink); color: white; }
footer {
  background: #191919; color: #aaa;
  padding: 28px 8%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; font-size: 12px;
}
footer strong { color: white; }
footer a:hover { color: var(--orange); }
@media(max-width: 760px) {
  header { padding: 18px 5%; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  nav { gap: 13px; }
  nav a { font-size: 10px; }
  .page-intro { padding: 50px 6%; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
  h1 { letter-spacing: -2px; }
  .story { margin: 0 6%; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .story-image, .story-image img { min-height: 270px; max-height: 340px; }
  .philosophy { padding: 60px 6%; }
  .philosophy-head { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; }
  .values { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .contact { padding: 48px 6%; align-items: start; flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <a class="logo" href="home.html">ORANGE<span>RIDE.</span></a>
  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a href="home.html">HOME</a>
    <a href="home.html#bikes">BIKES</a>
    <a href="about.html">OUR STORY</a>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">GET IN TOUCH ↗</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="page-intro">
  <div>
    <div class="kicker">OUR STORY / OUR PURPOSE</div>
    <h1>BUILT AROUND<br>THE <span>RIDE.</span></h1>
  </div>
  <p class="intro-copy">We believe a motorcycle is more than a way to travel. It is a connection between engineering, personal expression and the freedom to discover what's beyond the next turn.</p>
</section>

<section class="story">
  <div class="story-image">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558981403-c5f9899a28bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Motorcycle ready for an adventure">
  </div>
  <div class="story-copy">
    <div class="kicker">01 / THE IDEA</div>
    <h2>A DIFFERENT KIND OF MOTORCYCLE EXPERIENCE.</h2>
    <p>Orange Ride is a student-created motorcycle website concept inspired by bold European performance styling, expressive orange accents and the energy of life on two wheels.</p>
    <p>Our goal is to present motorcycle categories, design ideas and riding inspiration through a clear, modern digital experience.</p>
    <div class="signature">DESIGNED FOR THE NEXT JOURNEY.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="philosophy" id="philosophy">
  <div class="philosophy-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">02 / WHAT DRIVES US</div>
      <h2>OUR DESIGN PHILOSOPHY.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Every part of this concept has a purpose: communicate clearly, look distinctive and make exploration feel effortless.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="values">
    <article class="value">
      <div class="number">01 — PERFORMANCE</div>
      <h3>Purposeful Design</h3>
      <p>Strong typography, focused layouts and carefully selected imagery create a sense of movement without distracting from the content.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="value">
      <div class="number">02 — CHARACTER</div>
      <h3>Bold Identity</h3>
      <p>Orange highlights, neutral surfaces and confident visual contrasts give the website a consistent, recognisable personality.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="value">
      <div class="number">03 — EXPERIENCE</div>
      <h3>Made for Everyone</h3>
      <p>Responsive layouts and clear navigation help visitors explore the concept on desktop computers, tablets and mobile phones.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div>
    <h2>YOUR NEXT RIDE<br>STARTS HERE.</h2>
    <p>Explore the motorcycle collection or return to the homepage to discover the different riding styles.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="btn" href="home.html#bikes">EXPLORE THE BIKES ↗</a>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <strong>ORANGERIDE.</strong>
  <span>Independent student design concept · Not affiliated with KTM</span>
  <a href="home.html">← BACK TO HOME</a>
  <span>© <span id="year"></span> Orange Ride</span>
</footer>

<script>
document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="#"]').forEach(link => {
  link.addEventListener("click", event => {
    const target = document.querySelector(link.getAttribute("href"));
    if (target) {
      event.preventDefault();
      target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth" });
    }
  });
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
